hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"17098","Yahya ibn Ishaq narrated to us, from Yahya ibn Ayyub, he said: Yazid ibn Abi Habib narrated to me, from Rabi'ah ibn Laqit, from Abdullah ibn Hawalah, that the Messenger of Allah (peace and blessings of Allah be upon him) said: Whoever is saved from three has been saved, three times: my death, the Dajjal, and the killing of a caliph patient upon the truth, giving it."
